<view class="app-shell">
  <view class="top-area">
    <view class="saving-hero">
      <text class="hero-badge">会员专享</text>
      <view class="saving-title">省钱卡</view>
      <view class="saving-text">开通后可领取专属优惠券、购买省钱价商品，并获得会员日额外权益。</view>
      <view class="hero-price-line">
        <text class="hero-price">{{heroPriceText}}</text>
        <text class="hero-price-note">/ 月卡 · 预计月省 28 元</text>
      </view>
      <view class="action-row">
        <button class="button button-primary" bindtap="openCard">{{openButtonText}}</button>
        <button class="button button-secondary" bindtap="goMenu">先去点餐</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="page-main">
    <view class="section-card">
      <view class="section-head compact-head">
        <view>
          <view class="section-title">开通方案</view>
          <view class="section-note">切换后会同步更新顶部价格文案</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="plan-grid">
        <button class="plan-card is-active" wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id">
          <text class="plan-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="plan-price">{{item.priceText}}</text>
          <text class="plan-note">{{item.description}}</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-card">
      <view class="section-head">
        <view>
          <view class="section-title">专属优惠券</view>
          <view class="section-note">开卡后自动到账</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="coupon-stack">
        <view class="member-coupon" wx:for="{{coupons}}" wx:key="id">
          <text class="member-coupon-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="member-coupon-desc">{{item.conditionText}} · 减 {{item.discountText}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-card">
      <view class="section-head">
        <view>
          <view class="section-title">省钱价商品</view>
          <view class="section-note">仅省钱卡用户可享优惠价</view>
        </view>
        <text class="section-link" bindtap="goMenu">去点餐</text>
      </view>
      <view class="product-stack">
        <view class="product-card" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="goDetail">
          <image class="cover-thumb" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          <view class="product-body">
            <view class="product-name">{{item.name}}</view>
            <view class="product-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
            <view class="price-line">
              <text class="price">{{item.savingPriceText}}</text>
              <text class="old-price">{{item.priceText}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-card">
      <view class="section-head">
        <view>
          <view class="section-title">会员权益说明</view>
          <view class="section-note">开通后可领取专属券并享受指定商品优惠</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="benefit-list">
        <view class="benefit-item"><text class="benefit-icon">券</text><view><view class="info-title">专属优惠券</view><view class="info-text">每周固定领取饮品券和套餐券，可与日常活动叠加。</view></view></view>
        <view class="benefit-item"><text class="benefit-icon">价</text><view><view class="info-title">省钱价商品</view><view class="info-text">指定商品开放专属低价，适合与热门推荐商品联动。</view></view></view>
        <view class="benefit-item"><text class="benefit-icon">日</text><view><view class="info-title">会员日加码</view><view class="info-text">每周三会员日可额外领取一张高面额优惠券。</view></view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="bottom-nav">
    <navigator class="nav-item" url="/pages/home/index" open-type="redirect"><text class="nav-icon">首</text><text>首页</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="nav-item" url="/pages/menu/index" open-type="redirect"><text class="nav-icon">餐</text><text>点餐</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="nav-item is-active" url="/pages/saving-card/index" open-type="redirect"><text class="nav-icon">卡</text><text>省钱卡</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="nav-item" url="/pages/order/index" open-type="redirect"><text class="nav-icon">单</text><text>订单</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="nav-item" url="/pages/mine/index" open-type="redirect"><text class="nav-icon">我</text><text>我的</text></navigator>
  </view>
</view>
